('GTP01', 'Green Talao Park', 'Ecotourism and Education', 'Syekh Burhanuddin Street, Nagari Ulakan, Ulakan Tapakis District, Padang Pariaman Regency, West Sumatra Province, Indonesia, 25571', '09:00:00', '18:30:00', 5000, '082383985824', 'Green Talao Park is a tourist attraction that carries the concept of Ecotourism and Education. The location is in Korong Gantiang Tangah Padang, Nagari Ulakan, Ulakan Tapakis District, Padang Pariaman Regency. This area is located in the middle between Minangkabau International Airport and Pariaman City. If you are from the airport, it can take around 15-30 minutes to travel to the Green Talao Park location.', , NULL);

